    "explanation": "There is criticism of policy but no depiction of actors using direct force, violence, or intentionally aggressive domination."
  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "No suggestion of covert plots, espionage, betrayal, or deliberate misinformation; the critique is about evidence and harm, not deception."
  },
  "Institutional_Toxins": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "The US Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) guidance is framed as problematic—‘not supported by evidence’ and potentially causing harm—portraying an institutional failure/incompetence in policy-making."
  },
